shareholders to own ~49.9% and ~50.1% of the combined entity, respectively Consideration 1 &#167; Equity component valued at ~$4B based on Dana&#8217;s 5-day VWAP as of June 4, 2026 &#167; Cash distribution to Eaton at close of ~$1.1B, funded with
new debt, subject to adjustments for cash and debt 2 &#167; Estimated pro forma Dana net leverage at closing of ~1.2x ; expected to maintain Dana&#8217;s current credit rating &#167; R. Bruce McDonald will serve as Executive Chairman, Byron Foster
as Chief Executive Officer, (both effective July 1), Timothy Kraus remains Chief Financial Officer and Erin Rowse from Eaton will serve as Chief Human Operations &amp; Resources Officer effective at closing Governance &#167; Board of Directors to be
composed of current Dana Board (8 members) and 3 Eaton nominees &#167; Formalized process to track synergies and savings opportunities &#167; Subject to Dana shareholder approval, regulatory approvals, and customary closing conditions Timing &amp;
